Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.07,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(984,936)\3c&H151310&\c&H151310&\bord2\1a&HFF&\t(939,984,\1a&H00&)\t(4154,4199,\1a&HFF&)}Cutting Steel
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:55.07,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(984,936)\c&HE5E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Cutting Steel
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.13,0:01:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.67,0:01:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Nami, the climb\Nattack is a weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:02:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you have to rely on a stronger\None to use it, your brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.89,0:02:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to think to survive a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, your mind is the real weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, I've got key\Nballs and cool balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.21,0:02:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is take advantage of\Ntheir characteristics and combine them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.99,0:02:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tornado Tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.15,0:02:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the centerpiece\Nof the whole weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.89,0:02:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tornado Tempo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.93,0:02:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as your enemy is human,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.35,0:02:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they won't be able to stand\Nafter being struck by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.09,0:02:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's a last resort,\Nand you only get one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.13,0:02:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you miss, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:46.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I miss, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.97,0:02:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.93,0:02:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That little gadget of yours is\Ninteresting, but it's not a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.49,0:02:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's some advice, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:03:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you can't use it to attack,\Nit's nothing more than a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:02.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day that thing can\Nbe called a weapon is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.27,0:03:04.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the day you can finally\Nhurt someone with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.87,0:03:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.23,0:03:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop running.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't do something quick,\NI'm going to get skewered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.71,0:03:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only chance I've got is\Nthat tornado tempo thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.25,0:03:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Give that back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.05,0:03:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you seriously think you\Ncould kill me with this toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.09,0:03:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.05,0:03:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sweater can produce more\Nelectricity than this little thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we won't know unless I\Ntry, so give it back to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:44.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, think!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.09,0:03:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to distract her somehow so\Nshe can't dodge the tornado tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I have to work with?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.05,0:03:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are three different\Ntypes of air bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the extremely dry\Nweather of this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:04:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only there was just a little\Nmore moisture in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.09,0:04:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, moisture? That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.11,0:04:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing has a rain technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,RING TEMPLE!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.69,0:04:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water tricks?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.91,0:04:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ROTATING STRINKLER!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.47,0:04:18.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.38,0:04:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan, you'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.97,0:04:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of your party tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.89,0:04:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And speaking of parties,\Ntime to end this one. Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea urchin stinger!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.67,0:04:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now why don't you be a good\Nlittle girl for me and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:52.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that had been me instead of the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.43,0:04:57.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you showed me something\Ninteresting earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.81,0:05:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's only fair that I return the favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.25,0:05:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now's my chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:09.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.85,0:05:13.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,air rises while
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.83,0:05:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,absorbing moisture when
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it collides with cold\Nair that's descending!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.17,0:05:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It rapidly cools and the\Nmoisture gets frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.83,0:05:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:25.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Spike, Spike! Doping!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.71,0:05:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you your life was\Nover, didn't I? Spinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.31,0:05:54.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you've proven that you're\Na first-class expert at something,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.01,0:05:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even if it is running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, the air bubbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's small, but it formed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.87,0:06:15.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still not large enough, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to make it bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.09,0:06:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.85,0:06:21.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heat ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.87,0:06:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had about enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.43,0:06:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stinger, fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.43,0:06:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, are you prepared to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:45.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're just bluffing, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.11,0:07:32.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's forecast calls for pleasant weather\Nwith stable humidity and mild winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, a high-pressure system will be\Nmoving in sometime during the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This could create some strange\Nweather in one particular area,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so people in the vicinity\Nneed to watch out for mirages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And more importantly, for tornadoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.53,0:07:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the centerpiece\Nof the whole weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's a last resort,\Nand you only get one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you miss, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.89,0:08:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I miss, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.87,0:08:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tornado watch has been issued!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.11,0:08:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, it looks like that left\Nleg of yours is pretty injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.35,0:08:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much so, in fact, that\NI doubt you could run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.07,0:08:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sea Archen, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't hurt at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what kind\Nof pain she's been going through?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,compared to Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.19,0:08:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if I lose a foot\Nor a leg or two or even an arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:00.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.35,0:09:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, take this tornado!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.93,0:09:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?! What?! What?! What?! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.39,0:09:42.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.07,0:09:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.98,0:09:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.05,0:10:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.61,0:10:55.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.93,0:10:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's that, Phoebe?
