Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.95,0:11:13.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about? Pluton?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pluton.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to legend, it can completely\Nobliterate an island with just one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.75,0:11:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ancient weapon whose\Npower rivals that of a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.17,0:11:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's somewhere in this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.61,0:11:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but you already knew that,\Ndidn't you, your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.95,0:11:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ancient weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.31,0:11:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alabasta has such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.69,0:11:44.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And father knew about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it is a secret\Npassed down with the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acquiring Pluton has always been my goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.66,0:11:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this peaceful country\Nwill become a military
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.57,0:11:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power to be reckoned with under my rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your rule?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.27,0:11:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not this country's monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.29,0:12:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I soon will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once I'm on the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.55,0:12:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it will be easy to bring all the\Npirates in this area under my umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With such influence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,eventually I'll gain more power than\Neven the world government itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will dare cross me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world government would never\Nallow you to wield that much power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, they wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.21,0:12:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is the Pluton? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know where you\Nheard that name, Crocodile,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:29.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't have the slightest\Nidea as to where it could be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.65,0:12:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not even certain it ever existed,\Nlet alone if it's hidden in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.69,0:12:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a myth for all I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.75,0:12:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What you say probably\Nisn't a complete lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.13,0:12:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have considered that\Npossibility for a while now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that Pluton may have never existed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.53,0:12:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are those who believe it's just\Na fable, but I believe that it's real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What noisy incense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.81,0:13:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard that King Cobra's been\Ncrucified by crocodile up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.41,0:13:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to save his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.85,0:13:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can break through those\Ndoors, we can save the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.51,0:13:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.42,0:13:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't do anything because of those\Nstrange hands coming out from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible unless we find\Na way to stop those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.45,0:13:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my timing's correct, the rebel army\Nshould break through the defenses?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.23,0:13:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and reach that square in\Napproximately 20 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.01,0:13:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where they'll clash with the royal forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, in just half an hour, at 4.30,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.53,0:13:37.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their battle will be interrupted by a bomb\NI've ordered to be fired into the square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.93,0:13:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't, I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.83,0:13:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and it's no ordinary bomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But one so powerful it will destroy\Neverything within a five kilometer radius.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.83,0:13:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do that, everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.81,0:13:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.07,0:13:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one from either the royal army\Nor the rebel forces will survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll be wiped out and\Nthe battle will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.81,0:14:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be After all, you're the\None who wanted them to stop so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.61,0:14:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since I'll be ruling from this palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.77,0:14:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no need to blow it\Nup just to end their fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easier just to blow\Nboth armies up instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land's worth more than they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you be so callous toward them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did these people ever do\Nto you to deserve this, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.49,0:14:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have lives and families!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.97,0:14:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to kill\Nthem, crocodile! Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.45,0:14:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I'll change my mind if\Nthe king answers another question?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.81,0:14:44.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a poneglyph in\Nthis country, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.49,0:14:45.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.33,0:14:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poneglyph?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:48.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you promise to spare them,\NI'll tell you where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.41,0:14:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.59,0:15:01.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I'd expect from a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.15,0:15:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a wise man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.57,0:15:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot take...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,another second of this!
