Dialogue: 3,0:15:27.72,0:15:35.06,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2\pos(744,605)\fad(450,0)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx75.05\fscy96.9\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\4a&HFF&}Mehdi Assembly Hall, Main Street\NNorth Block
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.59,0:15:42.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me show you the difference in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.67,0:15:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pride between your swords and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style, full needle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,spider, defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So basically, your body\Nis as hard as steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.75,0:16:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless i can cut steel i can't defeat you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would be correct smashing and\Ncutting attacks won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.21,0:16:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that bites, doesn't\Nit? I'm not capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cutting steel yet so i\Nguess there's only one
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thing left to do and\Nwhat's that swordsman i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gonna learn how to cut\Nit right here and now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,really i've been waiting\Nfor a challenge just like
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.37,0:16:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this one i've been telling\Nmyself for a while now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.93,0:16:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that it's time to take my\Nskills to the next level
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.33,0:16:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when i defeat you mr one\Ni'll be the swordsman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strong enough to cut through anything
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,including steel
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.43,0:17:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,huh
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's rich i hate to shatter\Nyour delusions pirate but i
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feel it's only fair to warn you\Nthat ever since i gained dice
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dice powers i've never been\Nscratched by those who call
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,themselves swordsmen you'll\Nsoon see no enemy can defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh i'm really scared save those\Nstories for your grandkids if
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you live that long pal anyway\Ni don't know how many swordsmen
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:47.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've defeated but you've never\Nfought me before so you better
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,watch what you say big guy cuz\Nyou're about to eat those words!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only thing sharp\Nabout you is your tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine. I warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you won't last that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.81,0:18:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look who's talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.73,0:18:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.75,0:18:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.29,0:19:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.71,0:19:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got to admit, I'm surprised\Nyou don't even have a single bruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.21,0:19:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time\Nthis has ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No opponent of mine is standing\Nafter an attack like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As true as that may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've never fought against me before,\Nso who's eating their words now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.05,0:20:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's entire body is a blade, so\Nhis blades don't have a front or a back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparkling Daisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.03,0:20:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.27,0:20:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.17,0:21:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to training, I've\Ndone more than anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've also been pushed to the\Nbrink in plenty of bad situations,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.81,0:21:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but always succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.67,0:21:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what is it that I\Nlack to beat this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.81,0:21:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.81,0:21:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it true there are swordsmen in this\Nworld who can cut anything, even steel?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.61,0:21:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it certainly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.19,0:21:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.71,0:21:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to watch this\Npaper very carefully, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.49,0:21:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.69,0:21:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei, you didn't even cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.05,0:21:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Zoro, this is an\Nimportant lesson for you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are swordsmen out there who\Nare capable of cutting nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, these same swordsmen\Ncan also cut anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.51,0:22:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and that includes steel,\Nusing the same sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The strongest swordsmen\Nin the world are able
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to protect that which\Nthey want to protect,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.43,0:22:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but also cut that which they want to cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.13,0:22:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sword play that always\Nharms whatever it touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.93,0:22:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Zoro, that's not real swordsmanship.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.57,0:22:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.97,0:22:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensei, I'm going to be a\Nswordsman who can cut anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.21,0:22:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, were you listening at\Nall to what I was saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what are you waiting for?\NHurry up and attack me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never win if all you do is defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me pal there's\Nnothing i'd rather do more
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.83,0:23:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right now than that but\Nmy hands are a little Full
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at the moment and it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:12.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't a threat it was a
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.25,0:23:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,promise i'm gonna cut\Nsteel and you're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.63,0:23:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I highly doubt it. She\Nwon't be alive to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.93,0:23:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Large or small i'll cut\Neverything into pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swordplay that cuts nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.59,0:23:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell did that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.89,0:23:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.80,0:23:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut nothing but cut steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.87,0:23:46.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make any sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.07,0:23:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thrust and thrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.93,0:23:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the secret of powerful swordplay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.35,0:23:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Atomic Spar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.63,0:23:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who can cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.05,0:24:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really starting to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.09,0:24:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The feelings are mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.77,0:25:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we'd be evenly matched if I\Nwere a pathetic swordsman, but I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.47,0:25:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My weapons are far\Nnastier than mere swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.67,0:25:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this one for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.31,0:25:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.09,0:25:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An excavator?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.69,0:25:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An assassin, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.05,0:25:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparks!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.96,0:25:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just how fast are those blades spinning?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.81,0:25:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.95,0:25:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I don't mind\Nbeing called an excavator.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.15,0:25:41.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm going to be\Ndigging out your organs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.09,0:26:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing\Nleft for you after defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.65,0:26:04.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.97,0:26:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.45,0:26:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will not show my back to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.17,0:26:39.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you going to fight with?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.07,0:26:40.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.09,0:26:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.09,0:26:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Break!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.59,0:27:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Die in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.59,0:27:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had bad luck with stones today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.67,0:27:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the rest of them are okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.67,0:27:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.99,0:27:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cut him so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.59,0:27:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he dodge all those falling stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.23,0:28:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what I did?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.33,0:28:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge them?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.39,0:28:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.85,0:28:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just able to sense the\Nplace where no stones would fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.97,0:28:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them is underneath that stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.11,0:28:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.53,0:28:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.97,0:28:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've experienced this feeling before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.17,0:28:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything goes quiet around me so
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.27,0:28:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,quiet i can hear my heartbeat so clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.03,0:29:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this is this what it feels\Nlike when you're close to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.33,0:29:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was almost like like\Nthose falling stones
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.73,0:29:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gave me a hint as if\Nthey were living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.67,0:29:13.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it wasn't a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.85,0:29:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was much clearer than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.29,0:29:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was like... rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.09,0:29:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.59,0:29:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trees have their own rhythm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.61,0:29:26.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.81,0:29:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.93,0:29:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an important\Nlesson for you to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.99,0:29:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, there are swordsmen out there\Nwho are capable of cutting nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.95,0:29:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does cutting nothing mean\Nhearing the rhythm of the things?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.97,0:29:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around you if so is that how
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.97,0:29:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one can Cut steel what the
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.81,0:29:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hell did you do after a vicious\Nattack like that and all
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:30:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the blood you've lost There's\Nno way you can still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.97,0:30:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.61,0:30:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.07,0:30:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has a rhythm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.91,0:30:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like everything else around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.03,0:30:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.73,0:30:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.64,0:30:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I'm done, you're going\Nto wish you stayed down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.35,0:30:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only one question remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.17,0:30:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I really have the ability to cut steel?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.57,0:30:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's only one way to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.35,0:30:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You failed with three swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.33,0:30:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you defend yourself with only one?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.19,0:30:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.55,0:30:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're prepared to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.05,0:31:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One-Sword Style, Lion Song, Atomic Spurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.01,0:31:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.71,0:31:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've finally reached the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.75,0:31:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but he learned how\Nto do it, just like he said he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.43,0:31:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you've cut steel,\Nwhat's next for you, Diamonds?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.29,0:31:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.77,0:31:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.93,0:32:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
